ion: state recommendation (likely still C), refer to discussion, use explicit facts, explain why evidence supports or weakens. We can mention that B also lacks explicit evidence, so C remains best. Also note that we still need info on A and D.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with the panel that Candidate C remains the best, given reliability, decision speed, crew atmosphere, and that B also lacks evidence on attention/detail/responsibility, while A and D have other concerns.\" Then METADATA_JSON vote C.\n\nProceed."}
